{"name":"Destined for Greatness","hex":"#feddb1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"destined","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Confined to a predetermined fate or destiny; certain."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of destine"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/destined"},{"term":"for","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Fore."]},{"part":"Conjunction","definitions":["Because."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/for"},{"term":"greatness","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The state, condition, or quality of being great",": Pride; haughtiness."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greatness"}],"entries":[{"title":"TBJZL","blocks":[{"text":"Tobit John \"Tobi\" Brown, known professionally as TBJZL, is an English YouTuber, streamer, and influencer. He is a member and co-founder of the British YouTube group the Sidemen. He is the co-owner of XIX Vodka, Sidemen Clothing, restaurant chain Sides, and cereal brand Best Breakfasts."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/TBJZL_2025.jpg/330px-TBJZL_2025.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TBJZL"},{"title":"MFC 20","blocks":[{"text":"MFC 20: Destined for Greatness was a mixed martial arts event held by the Maximum Fighting Championship (MFC) on February 20, 2009, in Enoch, Alberta."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4f/MFC_20_Poster.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MFC_20"},{"title":"Greatness","blocks":[{"text":"Greatness is a concept of a state of exceptional superiority affecting a person or object in a particular place or area. Greatness can also be attributed to individuals who possess a natural ability to be better than all others. An example of an expression of the concept in a qualified sense would be \"Hector is the definition of greatness\" or \"Napoleon was one of the greatest wartime leaders\". In the unqualified sense it might be stated \"George Washington achieved greatness within his own lifetime\", thus implying that \"greatness\" is a definite and identifiable quality. Application of the terms \"great\" and \"greatness\" is dependent on the perspective and subjective judgements of those who apply them. Whereas in some cases the perceived greatness of a person, place or object might be agreed upon by many, this is not necessarily the case, and the perception of greatness may be both fiercely contested and highly idiosyncratic."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Peter_the_Great_statue_in_Saint_Petersburg.jpg/330px-Peter_the_Great_statue_in_Saint_Petersburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greatness"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/TBJZL_February_2019.jpg/330px-TBJZL_February_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/TBJZL_February_2019.jpg/330px-TBJZL_February_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Brown in 2019 at Vidcon London","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATBJZL_February_2019.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Peter_Paul_Rubens_-_The_Coronation_of_the_Hero_of_Virtue.jpg/330px-Peter_Paul_Rubens_-_The_Coronation_of_the_Hero_of_Virtue.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Peter_Paul_Rubens_-_The_Coronation_of_the_Hero_of_Virtue.jpg/330px-Peter_Paul_Rubens_-_The_Coronation_of_the_Hero_of_Virtue.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&